 "name_en": "Sales-Based Rent (3F4)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Sales-Based Rent (3F4)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioea8729becf244fa09dd847626c79905f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea8729becf244fa09dd847626c79905f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">With sales-based settlement, you have the ability to create a contract that captures terms and conditions of rental agreements including sales-based rent conditions. In this contract, one or more sales-based rent agreements are defined with valid rules for reporting and sales. These reporting and sales rules are then assigned to rent conditions.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Sales reports may be entered either for individual contracts (single entry) or as a collective entry for multiple contracts. Sales-based rents are then calculated and posted in Financial Accounting.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea8729becf244fa09dd847626c79905f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create rental agreement with sales-based conditions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assign reporting and sales rule to payment conditions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enter sales results into sales report</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate and post results into Financial Accounting</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea8729becf244fa09dd847626c79905f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Track sales values to support analysis by sales type and rental agreement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate amounts consistently based on the terms and conditions of the agreement, eliminating the use of spreadsheets and external calculation tools</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post sales results systematically to Financial Accounting, eliminating the need for manual general ledger postings and interfaces</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide auditable results based on the terms and conditions of the rental agreement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Track changes made to the rental agreement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Trace changes to the user who made the change</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>基于销售的租金 (3F4)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioea8729becf244fa09dd847626c79905f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea8729becf244fa09dd847626c79905f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过基于销售的结算，您可以创建捕获租赁协议条款和条件的合同，包括基于销售的租金条件。在此合同中，使用有效的报表和销售规则定义一个或多个基于销售的租金协议。然后，将这些报表和销售规则分配到租赁条件。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">可以为单个合同（单个条目）输入销售报表，也可以将其作为多个合同的集中输入进行输入。然后在财务会计中计算和过账基于销售的租金。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea8729becf244fa09dd847626c79905f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建具有基于销售的条件的租赁协议</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将报表和销售规则分配到付款条件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将销售结果输入到销售报表中</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">计算结果并将其过账到财务会计</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioea8729becf244fa09dd847626c79905f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">跟踪销售值，支持按销售类型和租赁协议进行分析</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据协议的条款和条件一致地计算金额，无需使用电子表格和外部计算工具</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将销售结果系统地过账到财务会计，无需手动进行总账过账和界面</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据租赁协议的条款和条件，提供可审计的结果</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">跟踪对租赁协议所做的更改</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">跟踪对进行更改的用户的更改</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
